\begin{SpecHeroTable}
\caption{Illustrative obligation-removal scenarios for the six PAC-2026 Core
coordinates. Each row explains the responsibility lost without the named
check; it does not demonstrate that the other five coordinates remain
conformant. Some omissions are already excluded by schema or profile admission.
